{
  "id": "1TH.5",
  "number": "5",
  "bookId": "1TH",
  "reference": "1 Batesalonike 5",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 28,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "5",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1TH 5"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "5",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ī mihayo ya shikū na makanza, ī yene badūgū natī na nguno ya kūng'wandīkīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno a bing'we benekīlī mumanile, gīkī ū lūshikū lo ng'wa Seeba lūkūshika gīt'ūmo ng'wibi akizaga būjikū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ng'wikanza īlo bakūsangwa bakūhayaga gīkī mhola na kaholele, bakūhayimanīla bisanganījiwa na būkenaagūji, gīt'ūmo būsūngū bo kūbyala būkansangaga nkīma ūyo alī nda; batūpūlūgūka na hado yaya! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike a bing'we badūgū, mutī banhū ba mu giiti, nose ū lūshikū lwenūlo lūng'wisanganīje. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno pye abo mulī baana ba ng'wisana mulī ba ng'wikanza lya līīmi. A bise tūtī ba ng'wikanza lya būjikū nūūlū tūtī ba mu giiti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū, tūlekagi ū kūlaala gīt'ūmo balī a bangī, alīyo twilang'hanagi tūbize na masala madeekanu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno a balaaji bakalaalaga būjikū, pye na a baleevi nabo bakaleebagwa būjikū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo a bise tūlī ba ng'wikanza lya līīmi, hū kūhaya tūbizagi na masala madeekanu, tūzwale kūzunya na būtogwa, shibize shizwalo shise sha chūma sha kūlang'hana shikuba; hama n'ihima lya kwisagīlwa kwa būpīji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ū Mulungu atatūsolile kūlwa kūgwa mu būpelanu bokwe, alīyo kūlwa kwanukūla būpīji mulī Seeba wise Yesu Kilisito, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ūyo akacha kūlwa nguno yise; gīkī tūbize bapanga hamò nang'hwe, ū ng'wikanza īlo tūlī bapanga nūūlū tūlaalile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū ng'wilūngūja na kwizenga, būlī ng'wene na a biye gīt'ūmo mukwītīlaga na kale.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Būkomeleja na būgīsha bo kūmalīja",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali lūūlū badūgū, tūtogilwe mubitegeleje a batongeeji abo bakwītaga milīmo mitaale kūlwa nguno ying'we, na kūmuhūgūla mulī Seeba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ūbinha ikūjo itaale mu būtogwa kūlwa nguno ya nīmo ūyo bakūgwītaga, hama na a bing'we ng'wikale mu mhola būlī ng'wene ū kū biye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na hangī badūgū tūlīmukomeleja muyūbahūgūla abo batadīlīlaga; na a babo bakūgwagang'holò ng'ūbagunanha, na a bagokolo ng'ūbaguzuhya. Hangī bizagi biyūmīlīja kū banhū bose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lang'hanagi atizilonga wa kūyūshosha yabūbi kūlwa kwītīlwa yabūbi, mubize na nhūngwa ja kwiyītīla yawiza gwa a bing'we benekīlī na benekīlī; pye na a bangī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yegagi gwa gwa gwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lombagi būlī lūshikū, yaya ū koya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lūmbagi mu būlī mhayo, nguno h'ūmo būlī ū būtogwa bo ng'wa Mulungu ū kū bing'we, ū mulī Kilisito Yesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaya ū kūnjimya ū Moyo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hama yaya nū kūbūdalahīja ū būhangi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'wīlola chiza pyī ī mihayo mu būdeeba, ī yawiza ng'wīdima; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "alīyo lekanagi nayo gete pyī ī yabūbi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū leki ū Mulungu wa mhola ang'weje wei ng'wenekīlī, na amulang'hane ū mu myoyo nū mu ng'holò, pyī nī mibīlī ying'we. Mubize banhū bashikanu, batī na shilingo ū mu lūshikū lwa kūshoka kwa ng'wa Seeba wise Yesu Kilisito. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūyo wang'witana ng'wene nsanyiwa, akūshikīlīja dūhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Badūgū, ng'ūtūlombela na a bise. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bagīshagi mu kwibbipa kwela pye a badūgū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nalīmukomeleja mulī Seeba gīkī, ī nyalūba yenīyī basomelwe pye a badūgū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shigongo sha ng'wa Seeba wise Yesu Kilisito shibize hamò ning'we. Alichene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
